    "README.md": "# {{agent_name}}\n\nTypeScript NovaOS agent scaffolded by `novaos-cli init --lang typescript`.\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nbun install\nbun run start\n```\n\n## SDK dependency\n\n`@novaos/agent-sdk` is a normal npm dependency, pinned in `package.json` — no\nmonorepo or manual vendoring required. `bun install` (or `npm install`)\nfetches it along with everything else.\n\n## Skill input shapes\n\nThe TypeScript Agent SDK extracts a **plain string** from ACP\n`body.input[0].parts[0].content` and passes it to `skill.input.parse`. Skill\nschemas must accept a string (e.g. `z.string()`), not an object.\n",
